OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAbout 2,000 residents evacuated in
OL,4,AFalmouth over unexploded WW2 bomb in
OL,5,Adocks
OL,6,
OL,7,FGWR has suspended it train services
OL,8,Fbetween Falmouth Docks and Falmouth
OL,9,FTown stations, with disruption expected
OL,10,Funtil 04:15
OL,12,FSuperintendent Ian Thompson, from Devon
OL,13,Fand Cornwall Police, previously warned:
OL,14,F"If the cordon is extended and you live
OL,15,Fwithin this area, you are strongly
OL,16,Furged to leave your home by 09:00 BST
OL,18,FAn evacuation centre has been set up at
OL,19,FAll Saints Church in Killigrew Street
OL,20,Fwith a variety of biscuits, tea, coffee
OL,21,Fand even phone chargers on hand for
OL,22,Fanyone displaced
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
